# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Fit different OLS models using the log-transformed target - every
#    formula below has "- 1" appended to force the intercept to exactly 0.
#    This is intentional, not just a style choice: on this log-log scale,
#    x=0 (identical configs on both sides of a pair) MUST give y_log=0
